    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slumbering Woods</i> is a cozy, hand-drawn exploration and mushroom-planting adventure set in a world recovering from a long-past climate catastrophe. You play as a travelling herbalist working to restore an isolated village overtaken by rising swamp waters while reconnecting its scattered community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, uncover ancient lore, discover forgotten crafting recipes in old books, and unravel the mysteries tied to the village and its surroundings. Customize your own abandoned hut, build relationships with the locals, and make impactful choices that influence the recovering ecosystem. With a flexible day/night cycle, you set the pace - work during the day, socialize in the evening, and track your progress in your journal as you bring the village back to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the landscape by growing floating mushroom islands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/ff1b70044191e0c745a969604c1c06fa.poster.avif?t=1750053515\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/ff1b70044191e0c745a969604c1c06fa.webm?t=1750053515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/ff1b70044191e0c745a969604c1c06fa.mp4?t=1750053515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Socialize with the locals at night.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/d664369f3f382a73b6b1edee8ff30e30.poster.avif?t=1750053515\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/d664369f3f382a73b6b1edee8ff30e30.webm?t=1750053515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/d664369f3f382a73b6b1edee8ff30e30.mp4?t=1750053515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultivate mushroom to solve puzzles and clear the land.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/7a1d6aed72ee053d8dc7cb78e4664682.poster.avif?t=1750053515\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/7a1d6aed72ee053d8dc7cb78e4664682.webm?t=1750053515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/7a1d6aed72ee053d8dc7cb78e4664682.mp4?t=1750053515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather resources to craft tools and materials with the help of the village\u2019s skilled inhabitants.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/2db2139ccdd029c33110c2c4bd644c9c.avif?t=1750053515\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Day/night cycle.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player can advance to the next part of the day when they feel ready.\u00a0Explore and craft during the day.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/3499edbbaca02c5ab238c6f5de85effc.poster.avif?t=1750053515\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/3499edbbaca02c5ab238c6f5de85effc.webm?t=1750053515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/3499edbbaca02c5ab238c6f5de85effc.mp4?t=1750053515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore dangerous but beautiful mushroom wilderness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/49a58f49f1b45b1345c8e5fc8da86f66.poster.avif?t=1750053515\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/49a58f49f1b45b1345c8e5fc8da86f66.webm?t=1750053515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/49a58f49f1b45b1345c8e5fc8da86f66.mp4?t=1750053515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find hidden mushrooms and learn how to grow them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/6e83dfb7446c8b371856605faa507acd.avif?t=1750053515\" width=757 height=907 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slumbering Woods</i> is a cozy, hand-drawn exploration and mushroom-planting adventure set in a world recovering from a long-past climate catastrophe. You play as a travelling herbalist working to restore an isolated village overtaken by rising swamp waters while reconnecting its scattered community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, uncover ancient lore, discover forgotten crafting recipes in old books, and unravel the mysteries tied to the village and its surroundings. Customize your own abandoned hut, build relationships with the locals, and make impactful choices that influence the recovering ecosystem. With a flexible day/night cycle, you set the pace - work during the day, socialize in the evening, and track your progress in your journal as you bring the village back to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the landscape by growing floating mushroom islands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/ff1b70044191e0c745a969604c1c06fa.poster.avif?t=1750053515\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/ff1b70044191e0c745a969604c1c06fa.webm?t=1750053515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/ff1b70044191e0c745a969604c1c06fa.mp4?t=1750053515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Socialize with the locals at night.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/d664369f3f382a73b6b1edee8ff30e30.p